<title>THAILAND: Rattana says bankruptcy suit settled.</title>
<headline>Rattana says bankruptcy suit settled.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai property firm, Rattana Real Estate Plc, said on Friday it had reached a compromise agreement with French construction firm Societe Auxiliare D'Entreprises which had filed a bankruptcy suit against it.</p>
<p>In a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand, Rattana said Societe Auxiliare would withdraw the suit against the company by today. No details were given.</p>
<p>Trading in Rattana shares was halted by the exchange after news of the suit against Rattana was reported in some local newspapers.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
